Попълнете липсващите стойности в SQL заявката за добавяне на нов клиент в таблицата customers. Заявката трябва да въведе стойности за колоните first_name, last_name, email и city (id се генерира автоматично от базата данни):

INSERT INTO customers (first_name, last_name, email, city)
VALUES ('____________', '____________', '____________', '____________');

В базата данни има пет таблици: customers, orders, order_items, products и categories. На схемата по-долу са показани колоните на всяка таблица. С химикал:
- отбележете кои полета са първични ключове (PK);
- отбележете кои полета са външни ключове (FK);
- начертайте стрелки/връзки между таблиците (customers -> orders, orders -> order_items, order_items -> products, products -> categories).

<div class="pkfk-scheme"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>customers</strong></caption><tr><td>id</td></tr><tr><td>first_name</td></tr><tr><td>last_name</td></tr><tr><td>email</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>orders</strong></caption><tr><td>id</td></tr><tr><td>customer_id</td></tr><tr><td>order_date</td></tr><tr><td>total_amount</td></tr><tr><td>status</td></tr><tr><td>shipping_address</td></tr><tr><td>notes</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>order_items</strong></caption><tr><td>id</td></tr><tr><td>order_id</td></tr><tr><td>product_id</td></tr><tr><td>quantity</td></tr><tr><td>unit_price</td></tr><tr><td>total_price</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>products</strong></caption><tr><td>id</td></tr><tr><td>product_name</td></tr><tr><td>description</td></tr><tr><td>price</td></tr><tr><td>stock_quantity</td></tr><tr><td>category_id</td></tr><tr><td>is_active</td></tr><tr><td>created_at</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>categories</strong></caption><tr><td>id</td></tr><tr><td>category_name</td></tr><tr><td>description</td></tr><tr><td>created_at</td></tr></table></div>

Попълнете липсващите стойности в SQL заявката за добавяне на нов продукт в таблицата products. Заявката трябва да въведе стойности за product_name, price, stock_quantity и category_id:

INSERT INTO products (product_name, price, stock_quantity, category_id)
VALUES ('____________', ____________, ____________, ____________);

В базата данни има пет таблици: clients, invoices, invoice_items, products и categories. На схемата по-долу са показани колоните на всяка таблица. С химикал:
- отбележете кои полета са първични ключове (PK);
- отбележете кои полета са външни ключове (FK);
- начертайте стрелки/връзки между таблиците (clients -> invoices, invoices -> invoice_items, invoice_items -> products, products -> categories).

<div class="pkfk-scheme"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>clients</strong></caption><tr><td>client_id</td></tr><tr><td>first_name</td></tr><tr><td>last_name</td></tr><tr><td>email</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>invoices</strong></caption><tr><td>invoice_id</td></tr><tr><td>client_id</td></tr><tr><td>invoice_date</td></tr><tr><td>total_amount</td></tr><tr><td>status</td></tr><tr><td>due_date</td></tr><tr><td>notes</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>invoice_items</strong></caption><tr><td>item_id</td></tr><tr><td>invoice_id</td></tr><tr><td>product_id</td></tr><tr><td>quantity</td></tr><tr><td>unit_price</td></tr><tr><td>total_price</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>products</strong></caption><tr><td>product_id</td></tr><tr><td>product_name</td></tr><tr><td>description</td></tr><tr><td>price</td></tr><tr><td>stock_quantity</td></tr><tr><td>category_id</td></tr><tr><td>is_active</td></tr><tr><td>created_at</td></tr></table><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="4"><caption><strong>categories</strong></caption><tr><td>category_id</td></tr><tr><td>category_name</td></tr><tr><td>description</td></tr><tr><td>created_at</td></tr></table></div>
